WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.200
What's up, D.C.!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.320
There's a lot of anti-immigrant
sentiment right now.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.200
People need to know
that we love America.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.200
We come here for a reason,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.920
and we contribute to America
in many ways, right?

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.760
Some immigrants actually voted for Trump
because they wanted fewer taxes,

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.560
but they ended up with fewer relatives.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.720
And I went down to the protest, yeah!

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.080
It's so much fun.
Suddenly, the riot police came out.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.040
But the white dudes did not care!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.080
They're just, "Out of my way, copper.
Here I come. It's my right."

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.640
I'm in the back.
I'm like, "Calm down, white guy!"

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.760
"You're gonna get us in trouble!"

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.520
Kids are running the world now.
You know how I know?

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.600
'Cause when I was a kid,
I used to have to play

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.080
with the kids of my parents' friends.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.120
Now I have to play with the parents
of my kids' friends.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.160
Now, in America, you got to put
your kid in a car seat...

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.040
till they're 35 years old,
with a helmet on,

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.120
and a video player, just--

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.800
This is a learning experience,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.520
Immigrants giving to the culture.

